  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Lang Ya land spirit and the hairy man Gu Immortals assemble Heavenly Giant Solor, the land spirit at the central formation core says that formation was the second strongest battle formation in the world even during the Olden Antiquity Era, merely second to Golden Heavenly Saint.",
      "chapters": [
        883
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_heavenly_giant_solor",
        "evt_era_olden"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Within such a formation strengths combine as one entity, soul foundations add up, immortal essence can be used interchangeably, and thoughts communicate freely. Hei Cheng names ancient battle formations among the pinnacle of formation path, methods that let Gu Immortals work together and add battle strength, and says historical reasons have already buried that type of battle formation within the River of Time. Qin Bai Sheng notes Heavenly Giant Solor was in Long Hair Ancestor’s hands, and Hei Cheng treats Long Hair Ancestor as a famous person throughout history who had the power to collect such an ancient battle formation.",
      "chapters": [
        883
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-traits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Green City Rampage is named a powerful battle formation of the Olden Antiquity Era that ranked third in the world, only lower than Golden Heavenly Saint and Heavenly Giant Solor.",
      "chapters": [
        941
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ranking-against-peers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_green_city_rampage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan facing Green City Rampage again recalls the same ranking: only weaker than Heavenly Giant Solor and Golden Heavenly Saint.",
